# REQ-001 — Runtime Profile Adapter Layer

## Scope

REQ-001 delivers a **profile-selected adapter layer** that provides five infrastructure ports — object storage, queue, eventing, secrets, and log sink — switchable between `aws` and `onprem` profiles via the `DEPLOYMENT_PROFILE` environment variable.

Business logic depends only on abstract port interfaces (`shared.adapters.ports`). Concrete adapters are resolved at registry construction time; no business module imports a concrete adapter directly.

